# VMS-41R1 preexecution freeze audit checklist

- [ ] The command writes only `live_fixtures/poc_vms_41r1.freeze.json` unless a caller supplies an explicit test output path.
- [ ] The manifest binds 371/372 protocol hashes, the VMS41R1 qualification pack hash and the 0.4.1 role asset hashes.
- [ ] The manifest authorizes zero model, Devin session, Solver, DB, Redis, network and subagent calls.
- [ ] `attempt_ids` covers exactly the six VMS41R1 qualification cases and has no duplicates.
- [ ] The manifest explicitly says live attempts require a new authorization and blind manual audit is not started.
- [ ] Existing freeze content is byte-verified append-once; drift fails closed.
